e('`action` records whether security groups and NACLs allowed the traffic, which makes flow logs the first place to look when "the firewall is blocking something".', '`action` reports ACCEPT or REJECT. A rejection can arise from security groups, NACLs or packets arriving after connection closure; this field alone does not identify a particular rule.', 'AWS explicitly includes rejection after connection closure.', ['https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/flow-log-records.html'])
